# What `vsce package` leaves out of the .vsix: the extension runs from the
# esbuild bundle in dist/ (built by vscode:prepublish), so sources, tests,
# editor config and source maps are not shipped.
src/**
test/**
.vscode/**
node_modules/**
tsconfig.json
esbuild.config.mjs
**/*.map
**/*.test.*
*.vsix
